    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "For liquid medium: Dispense the medium into suitable culture vessels and autoclave at 121°C for 15 minutes under a N2 atomosphere."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "For agar plate: Sterilizing by autoclaving at 121°C for 15 minutes. After autoclaving, cool to about 50°C, and dispense into sterile petri dishes."
